+    "# 05 · `fact_inventario` — foto diaria de stock\n",
+    "**IDY1102 · Experiencia 3 · DataRetail 360**\n",
+    "\n",
+    "| Campo | Detalle |\n",
+    "|---|---|\n",
+    "| Responsable | [Victor Navarrete] |\n",
